{"id":"591d2dd45b17cf85","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-bitheory.md","title":"Bi-theories justify both output labels by sample patterns","display":"df-bitheory — Bi-theories justify both output labels by sample patterns","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-bitheory","aliases":["27-df-bitheory"],"display":"df-bitheory — Bi-theories justify both output labels by sample patterns","depends_on":["[[27-df-pattern]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.4 Bi-theories","source_printed_pages":"525","source_pdf_pages":"549","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-explicit-complement-representation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-bitheory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-bitheory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bitheory — Bi-theories justify both output labels by sample patterns"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.4 Bi-theories"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"525"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"549"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-explicit-complement-representation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cap F=\\emptyset\">\\(T\\cap F=\\emptyset\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b4178d75957ed66\" href=\"?note=5b4178d75957ed66\" title=\"27-df-pattern\">27-df-pattern</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(F,T)\\;\n(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)(a)=1-f(a)))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(F,T)\\;\n(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)(a)=1-f(a)))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §12.2.4，印刷 p.525／PDF p.549。f由覆盖T且避F的模式析取表示，其补也须由覆盖F且避T的copattern析取表示。这里保存语义函数，分别存在两份DNF；不把“取一个DNF逐文字否定”误当补函数。双空样本时两种TheoryDNF都只有空DNF，因此此类为空，这个退化边界影响下一存在定理的适用范围。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pattern]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pattern","status":"resolved","id":"5b4178d75957ed66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$；$\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}$、$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pattern]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\cap F=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n(T,F)\\coloneqq\n\\{f\\in\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\mid\n\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(T,F)\\;\\exists E\\in\\mathrm{TheoryDNF}(F,T)\\;\n(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)(a)=1-f(a)))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1541,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-bitheory|df-bitheory — Bi-theories justify both output labels by sample patterns]]"},{"id":"cc181bc37a9aa393","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$T\\cap F=\\emptyset$、$T\\cup F\\ne\\emptyset$；$\\mathrm{BiTheory}_n$ 见 [[27-df-bitheory]]。$d_H:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb N$ 与 $d:\\mathbb B^n\\times\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\to\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$ 由下式构造；$\\min\\emptyset=\\infty$，$\\infty$ 大于每个自然数。$f_*:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["5b4178d75957ed66"]}